OL,3,GNEWSAChris Brown given suspended
OL,4,Aeight-month prison sentence over London
OL,5,Anightclub attack
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS singer Chris Brown has been
OL,8,Fsentenced to eight months in prison -
OL,9,Fsuspended for a year - over an incident
OL,10,Fat a nightclub in Mayfair, London in
OL,11,F2023
OL,13,FBrown, 37, pleaded guilty in July to a
OL,14,Fcharge of affray - here's a recap of
OL,15,Fwhat we heard in court
OL,17,FThe victim, music producer Abe Diaw,
OL,18,Fneeded hospital treatment for head and
OL,19,Fknee injuries, with CCTV showing Brown
OL,20,Fhitting Diaw on the head with a glass
OL,21,Fbottle
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
