OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAChris Brown given suspended
OL,4,Aeight-month prison sentence over London
OL,5,Anightclub attack
OL,6,
OL,7,FDelivering his sentencing remarks,
OL,8,FJudge Tony Baumgartner said "the
OL,9,Frepeated use" of a bottle was "plainly
OL,10,Fdangerous"
OL,12,FAcknowledging the incident was "short",
OL,13,Fthe judge said it was also "intense".
OL,14,FEarlier, defence barristers said it was
OL,15,F"ugly and unattractive" but "very
OL,16,Fshort-lived"
OL,18,FBrown's co-defendant and vocal coach,
OL,19,F40-year-old Omololu Akinlolu, got a
OL,20,Ffour-month sentence - also suspended
OL,21,Ffor a year
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
